If you can get your alignment to 14 or greater, your deity will grant
you favors, so you can pray for hp even when your maxhp is greater than
15.  You could get your maxhp arbitrarily high while still at clvl 1.
If you can find a co-aligned priest, donating 600 per clvl will
increase your alignment by 2 if the amount is greater than 1/3 your
visible gold.  If you already have naked AC 1, then 400 per clvl will
also have this effect when you don't get the protection effect.  You
can get to 14 alignment by killing monsters as well and still remain
level 1, since kobold zombies have -2 alignment and are worth only 1xp.
 Goblins have -3 alignment and have 6xp.  To remain level 1, you just
have to stay under 20xp.  Today I had 10 alignment by the time I got to
minetown and the priest happened to be co-aligned, so I got to naked AC
1 and 14 alignment, thinking I would go for naked AC -10 while still
level 1, praying for hp every 350 moves, but my dog ran amok, attacking
several watchmen and getting killed, leaving me to deal with a
werejackal, some gnomes and some dwarfs.  The expensive camera and +2
darts saved my hide, but I had to give up my ambition of being a level
1 tank.

